LGPL-2.1-or-later — xemu's NV2A GPU model and Vulkan renderer
------------------------------------------------------------

  https://github.com/xemu-project/xemu (hw/xbox/nv2a)

  src/nv2a_vk/xemu/ holds xemu's NV2A model, imported verbatim and then
  extended for xboxrecomp (render scale, shadow-map scale, shader and
  pipeline caches, frame pacing): the hardware blocks (pfifo.c, pgraph,
  ptimer.c, pcrtc.c, pfb.c, pmc.c, pramdac.c, pvideo.c and the others), the
  graphics engine in pgraph/, its Vulkan renderer in pgraph/vk/ and its
  shader generators in pgraph/glsl/. Each file keeps its own header; the
  copyrights they carry are those of espes (2012-2015), Jannik Vogel
  (2014-2015), Matt Borgerson (2018-2025), with Aaron Robinson (2004),
